# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is the SECOND line of defence, not the first.
#
# The first is that sensitive material lives in ../matbakh-private/, outside
# this folder, where git cannot see it. The third is .githooks/pre-commit,
# which blocks a commit whatever tool made it. Install it: ./setup-guards.sh
#
# Audit all three at any time: ./scan.sh
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── The vault, in case it is ever copied or symlinked in by mistake ──────────
matbakh-private/
**/matbakh-private/
DO-NOT-COMMIT*

# ── The recipe catalogue is the product. Template + one demo recipe only. ────
content/recipes/*
!content/recipes/_template.yaml
!content/recipes/molokhia_bil_farakh.yaml
!content/recipes/README.md

# ── Business documents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.numbers
*.pages
financials/
strategy/
research/
partners/

# ── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa*
*.ppk
secrets.*
*.secret
*credentials*
*api_key*
*apikey*

# ── Local tooling, not part of the published site ───────────────────────────
bridge_server.py
matbakh_authoring.html
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# ── OS and editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── Claude Design exports: self-contained email copies, not site files ──────
*(offline).html
.bundles/
